Shopify Ajax API endpoint catalog — hand-curated from Shopify's official
documentation at https://shopify.dev/docs/api/ajax (2026-05).

Unlike Admin/Storefront GraphQL (which Shopify exposes via introspection)
or webhook payloads (which Gadget Inc. publishes JSON Schemas for), the
Ajax API has no machine-readable schema. The endpoint set, parameter
shapes, and response field lists in this catalog are transcribed from
the human-readable docs at:

  https://shopify.dev/docs/api/ajax/reference/cart
  https://shopify.dev/docs/api/ajax/reference/product
  https://shopify.dev/docs/api/ajax/reference/product-recommendations
  https://shopify.dev/docs/api/ajax/reference/predictive-search

The Ajax API is theme-only and not API-version-pinned. Refresh by hand
when Shopify updates the docs (rarely needed).
